    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/6be6867275d00fdf7d7b34f4bb7242f2.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Timber invites you to master the art of resource management and city-building. From humble beginnings to an industrial empire, harvest resources, trade strategically, and watch your city flourish.<br><br>Experience seamless city-building with Timber's intuitive placing system! Watch as your creations come to life with effortless precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover the power of progression with Timber's innovative leveling system! Watch as your empire evolves and grows, reaching new heights with each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready to seize opportunities as train orders arrive, shaping your empire's success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Watch as your city evolves and grows with each new residence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the depths of strategic resource management, the excitement of dynamic trade, and the satisfaction of building a thriving city in Timber. With endless possibilities and challenges awaiting, the journey to urban greatness begins now. Are you ready to forge your empire?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/6be6867275d00fdf7d7b34f4bb7242f2.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Timber invites you to master the art of resource management and city-building. From humble beginnings to an industrial empire, harvest resources, trade strategically, and watch your city flourish.<br><br>Experience seamless city-building with Timber's intuitive placing system! Watch as your creations come to life with effortless precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/240f498cef7deccf5c2eef00739edeff.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover the power of progression with Timber's innovative leveling system! Watch as your empire evolves and grows, reaching new heights with each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/232ea79eb7ea7934db8ed4c575b07fd8.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready to seize opportunities as train orders arrive, shaping your empire's success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/88af597107b2aae876be28fd9cf6a8d8.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Watch as your city evolves and grows with each new residence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.poster.avif?t=1709139969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.webm?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795030/extras/9f6bfbddfba25791ab13493396a7abae.mp4?t=1709139969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the depths of strategic resource management, the excitement of dynamic trade, and the satisfaction of building a thriving city in Timber. With endless possibilities and challenges awaiting, the journey to urban greatness begins now. Are you ready to forge your empire?",
